# Reality

Reality is a conceptual tool or principle that helps understand and navigate complex situations. It provides a mental shortcut or framework for making sense of patterns and relationships in the world.

This source references Sönke Ahrens' work on world-disclosure, suggesting reality is actively constructed through experimentation and exploration rather than passively received.
---